    'Kansleri Cookie Consent is now active. Next steps: %1$s to discover cookies and %2$s to review banner and consent settings.' => 'Kansleri Cookie Consent tagad ir aktīvs. Nākamie soļi: %1$s, lai atrastu sīkdatnes, un %2$s, kas attiecas uz baneri un piekrišanu.',
    'Klaviyo: recognises returning visitors for email marketing.' => 'Klaviyo: atpazīst atgriezušos apmeklētājus e-pasta mārketingam.',
